 listed companies (domestic market cap) were: New York Stock Exchange (NYSE) – <strong>US$44.7 trillion market cap; monthly cash equity trading volume ~US$2.7 trillion</strong>.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d22cb18f31e01cb2\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"February 12, 2026\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.economyinsights.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"cc4bc6da33217ac1\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nNasdaq: monthly domestic market cap 2023 | Statista\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"cc4bc6da33217ac1\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.statista.com/statistics/1330797/nasdaq-monthly-domestic-market-cap/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"fa5c6c665fd1b3bd\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nWFE. &quot;Monthly Market Capitalization of Domestic Listed Companies on The Nasdaq Stock Exchange from <strong>January 2018 to July 2023 (in Trillion U.S.</strong>\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"fa5c6c665fd1b3bd\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.statista.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d10f0b6e1e55d6c4\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMarket Statistics - February 2025\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d10f0b6e1e55d6c4\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://focus.world-exchanges.org/issue/february-2025/market-statistics\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"4ff936ea6e21bd34\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nBy: The WFE Statistics Team Jan 2025 · Domestic Market Capitalisation · Listed Companies · EOB Value Traded ·\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"4ff936ea6e21bd34\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"focus.world-exchanges.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"65861c3dcfb0ef71\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nEquity market capitalization globally 2024| Statista\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"65861c3dcfb0