/", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"15ce3089ab526792\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nTotal market capitalizations of companies listed on stock exchanges worldwide from 2013 to 2024 (in trillion U.S. dollars) [Graph], WFE, <strong>March 10, 2025</strong>.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"15ce3089ab526792\">>>", "published": "March 3, 2026", "siteName": "www.statista.com"}]}, "isError": false, "timestamp": 1775584599627}}
