{"type": "message", "id": "2b20515d", "parentId": "14d055fc", "timestamp": "2026-04-07T18:00:04.194Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_2c8c20f05b0c4c8281449831", "toolName": "web_search", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"query\": \"WFE world exchanges monthly report January 2025 NASDAQ market cap \\\"35\\\" OR \\\"36\\\" OR \\\"37\\\" OR \\\"38\\\" trillion listed companies value traded\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 989,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f599d393acd15d75\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nStatistics\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f599d393acd15d75\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.world-exchanges.org/our-work/statistics\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"134f3d11106186a3\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nWe invite you to access the Statistics Portal using the link below and the WFE’s monthly and annual reports as below. Access Statistics Portal · A compilation of the main structural elements observed across markets, including market hours, volatility control mechanisms, and trading rules can be found in the Exchanges Factsheets. You can access the Exchanges Factsheets through the interactive page (link below) or you can download them here Exchanges Factsheets (updated: Jan 2025).\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"134f3d11106186a3\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.world-exchanges.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"10966edd4bf99488\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nFY 2024 Market Highlights Foreword\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"10966edd4bf99488\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://wfe-live.lon1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/org_focus/storage/media/Cally%20Billimore/WFE%20FY%202024%20Market%20Highlights%20Report%2010022025.pdf\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3c748cf7c47cec5d\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n<strong>125.71 trillion</strong>, due to growth in the Americas and APAC regions, while EMEA experienced a decline.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3c748cf7c47cec5d\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"wfe-live.lon1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5a868fe58da186d8\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nNew WFE Data: Public Markets Post Strong Growth For 2025 Despite Geopolitical Instability\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5a868fe58da186d8\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://mondovisione.com/media-and-resources/news/new-wfe-data-public-markets-post-strong-growth-for-2025-despite-geopolitical-in-2026227/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"348af12eda28358e\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n<strong>Over USD 23 trillion was added to stock markets worldwide</strong>. Each region reached its highest market capitalisation in the 5-year period. Trading value rose 36.8% compared to 2024, with double-digit increases in every region.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"348af12eda28358e\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"February 27, 2026\",\n      \"siteName\": \"mondovisione.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"795cdbde8a4091d0\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nWelcome to the future of markets\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"795cdbde8a4091d0\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.world-exchanges.org/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8b53a15f1cfecafb\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nWe publish over 350 market data indicators, ranging from statistics on exchange traded products such as equities, derivatives and ETFs to granular data on IPOs, and the WFE’s Median Simple Spread liquidi